00:14:59.292 --> 00:15:00.417
"Code Name: Womanizing Scumbag"
Especially you, Womanizing Scumbag!

00:15:00.417 --> 00:15:03.000
"Code Name: Womanizing Scumbag"
Always hold your gun at firing height!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.708
"Code Name: Womanizing Scumbag"
Dammit! Like I'll let you escape!

00:15:04.708 --> 00:15:08.208
Director Mushroom! Mistress Kanzaki! Fluffy Stag Beetle!

00:15:08.208 --> 00:15:09.333
He's headed your way!

00:15:09.333 --> 00:15:11.208
Got it!

00:15:12.375 --> 00:15:15.167
Ah! He went another way!

00:15:15.167 --> 00:15:15.208
Home Plate!

00:15:15.208 --> 00:15:16.042
"Code Name: Home Plate"
Home Plate!

00:15:16.042 --> 00:15:16.875
"Code Name: Loofah"
Loofah!

00:15:16.875 --> 00:15:18.083
"Code Name: Picture-Book Graduate"
Picture-Book Graduate!

00:15:18.083 --> 00:15:20.042
On it!

00:15:20.042 --> 00:15:23.417
Get him looking at the ground, and...

00:15:25.167 --> 00:15:26.250
Nicely done,

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.792
"Code Name: Pseudo-Takaoka"
Pseudo-Takaoka.

00:15:27.792 --> 00:15:29.250
But it's not enough!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:33.750
Scoring one hit on me doesn't mean
you can ever take <i>him </i>down!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:34.083
Poison Specs! Forever Flat!

00:15:34.083 --> 00:15:36.000
"Code Name: Forever Flat" "Code Name: Poison Specs"
Poison Specs! Forever Flat!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.083
"Code Name: Forever Flat" "Code Name: Poison Specs"
If I can see where you're firing from,

00:15:37.083 --> 00:15:38.583
"Code Name: Forever Flat" "Code Name: Poison Specs"
I can dodge your shots!

00:15:38.583 --> 00:15:39.333
I can dodge your shots!

00:15:39.333 --> 00:15:41.792
He saw us! Take over,

00:15:41.792 --> 00:15:43.167
Dignified Didact!

00:15:43.167 --> 00:15:43.333
Okay! C'mon, English Lass and Gender!

00:15:43.333 --> 00:15:44.708
"Code Name: Dignified Didact"
Okay! C'mon, English Lass and Gender!

00:15:44.708 --> 00:15:45.333
Okay! C'mon, English Lass and Gender!

00:15:45.333 --> 00:15:46.792
"Code Name: Gender" "Code Name: English Lass"
Okay! C'mon, English Lass and Gender!

00:15:46.792 --> 00:15:48.000
"Code Name: Gender" "Code Name: English Lass"
Roger!

00:15:50.792 --> 00:15:54.375
Nice shooting this time,
without giving away their location.

00:15:54.375 --> 00:15:57.125
Must be Dignified Didact's leadership.

00:15:57.125 --> 00:16:00.208
"Code Name: This Manga is Amazing!" "Code Name: Terminal Perv"
Keep your distance from behind, then wait for your chance...

00:16:00.208 --> 00:16:04.000
Terminal Perv and This Manga
is Amazing! aren't bad, either.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.042
Semi-Senioritis has blocked the escape route!

00:16:05.042 --> 00:16:06.917
"Code Name: Semi-Senioritis"
Semi-Senioritis has blocked the escape route!

00:16:06.917 --> 00:16:08.208
We're counting on you,

00:16:08.208 --> 00:16:08.375
"Code Name: Dating Sim Emo Character"
We're counting on you,

00:16:08.375 --> 00:16:10.583
"Code Name: Dating Sim Emo Character"
Dating Sim Emo Character!

00:16:19.417 --> 00:16:24.417
Dating Sim Emo Character!
Assume your target is always on guard!

00:16:24.417 --> 00:16:26.000
I know.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.917
But I'm not the one who'll take you down.

00:16:28.917 --> 00:16:30.333
Justice!

00:16:41.417 --> 00:16:42.625
So how did it feel,

00:16:42.625 --> 00:16:44.833
spending the day under code names?

00:16:44.833 --> 00:16:47.583
Kind of... painful.

00:16:47.583 --> 00:16:49.875
"Scrunchies and Boobs"?

00:16:49.875 --> 00:16:52.042
Being called "Amazing Ape" over and over...

00:16:52.042 --> 00:16:54.000
Ah, yes, I see, I see.

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:56.583
What does "Box o' Moe" mean?

00:16:56.583 --> 00:16:58.708
Probably exactly that.

00:16:58.708 --> 00:17:00.708
Koro Sensei!

00:17:00.708 --> 00:17:03.750
Why was I the only one with my real name?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:07.125
Because I knew what you'd be
doing in phys ed training today.

00:17:07.125 --> 00:17:10.583
I figured, with your mobility,
you'd play quite a role.

00:17:10.583 --> 00:17:13.333
And given the awesome moves you pulled off,

00:17:13.333 --> 00:17:16.667
the name "Justice" is a perfect fit.

00:17:16.667 --> 00:17:18.667
So it is!

00:17:19.417 --> 00:17:22.250
"Petition for Name Change" "Justice Kimura" "Masayoshi Kimura"
Just to reassure you, Kimura,

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:25.708
"Petition for Name Change" "Justice Kimura" "Masayoshi Kimura"
it should be relatively easy to put in for a name change.

00:17:25.708 --> 00:17:27.292
it should be relatively easy to put in for a name change.

00:17:27.292 --> 00:17:28.792
Oh, right!

00:17:28.792 --> 00:17:30.708
Still, Kimura...

00:17:30.708 --> 00:17:37.625
If you kill me, I bet this is how
the world will see your name:

00:17:37.625 --> 00:17:43.625
"'Justice' indeed! A perfect name
for the hero who saved Earth!"

00:17:44.917 --> 00:17:47.292
To be honest, there's no
great meaning to the grand names

00:17:47.292 --> 00:17:49.667
our parents give us.

00:17:49.667 --> 00:17:54.833
What's meaningful is what we,
so named, accomplish in our lives.

00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:56.708
Names don't make a person.

00:17:56.708 --> 00:18:01.708
They're merely left behind in
our footsteps as we walk through life.

00:18:01.708 --> 00:18:06.375
How about cherishing
that name for a while longer?

00:18:06.375 --> 00:18:08.458
At least...

00:18:11.542 --> 00:18:14.750
...until the assassination's over with.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.167
Okay?

00:18:19.167 --> 00:18:21.958
I think I will.

00:18:21.958 --> 00:18:25.875
So! Today's the day we used code names.

00:18:25.875 --> 00:18:28.375
Now to tell you mine!

00:18:28.375 --> 00:18:31.167
Please call me this from now on:

00:18:31.167 --> 00:18:31.750
"Prince of the Fateful Eternal Wind"
Please call me this from now on:

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:36.125
"Prince of the Fateful Eternal Wind"
"Prince of the Fateful Eternal Wind."

00:18:38.042 --> 00:18:40.542
Why do <i>you </i>get to pick
such a fancy-pants name?!

00:18:40.542 --> 00:18:43.250
And what's with that smug look?

00:18:43.250 --> 00:18:46.292
Aw, c'mon, why not? Just for one day!

00:18:46.292 --> 00:18:48.375
Koro Sensei spent the rest of the day

00:18:48.375 --> 00:18:51.542
"Code Name: The Octopus of the Idiotic Perverted Chicken"
as "The Octopus of the Idiotic Perverted Chicken."

00:18:51.542 --> 00:18:53.417
"Code Name: The Octopus of the Idiotic Perverted Chicken"
"The Octopus of the Idiotic Perverted Chicken!"

00:18:53.417 --> 00:18:54.500
"Code Name: The Octopus of the Idiotic Perverted Chicken"
Huh? Octopus?!

00:18:56.333 --> 00:18:57.792
That was a blast!

00:18:57.792 --> 00:18:59.292
"Code Name: Specs (LOL)"

00:18:59.292 --> 00:19:02.833
Sure was funny today,
using code names in class.

00:19:02.833 --> 00:19:03.958
Sure was.

00:19:03.958 --> 00:19:05.833
Right, Picture-Book Graduate?

00:19:05.833 --> 00:19:08.833
Can it, Baseball Geek.

00:19:08.833 --> 00:19:09.958
Ouch!

00:19:09.958 --> 00:19:11.875
What does it even mean?

00:19:11.875 --> 00:19:15.500
Yeah, and whose big idea
was it to put me down

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.833
as "Forever Flat," huh?

00:19:16.833 --> 00:19:18.250
Gulp!

00:19:19.292 --> 00:19:19.500
So it was you.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.375
"Code Name: The Art of Darkness"
So it was you.

00:19:21.375 --> 00:19:21.583
So it was you.

00:19:21.583 --> 00:19:23.875
See you tomorrow.

00:19:24.667 --> 00:19:28.958
Hey, I'll put up with that
nasty ramen again today. C'mon.

00:19:28.958 --> 00:19:30.667
Now look here...

00:19:30.667 --> 00:19:33.042
He's totally a Terasaka guy.

00:19:33.042 --> 00:19:34.875
He really is.

00:19:34.875 --> 00:19:40.542
And so the days went on,
each of us giving it our all.

00:19:40.542 --> 00:19:46.792
But we were the End Class.
Our fun times couldn't last forever.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.708
How's the second term coming?

00:19:52.708 --> 00:19:59.583
Of course, "poorly" isn't
an option in my son's A Class.

00:19:59.583 --> 00:20:01.583
It's going smoothly.

00:20:01.583 --> 00:20:04.625
I'm thorough in my handling of any students

00:20:04.625 --> 00:20:07.208
who lag behind even the slightest bit.

00:20:07.208 --> 00:20:11.833
I'll train everyone up even higher
with an eye on the midterms.

00:20:11.833 --> 00:20:13.833
How encouraging.

00:20:13.833 --> 00:20:19.042
However... the students are
still talking about you

00:20:19.042 --> 00:20:22.667
letting the E Class
get carried away in the first term--

00:20:22.667 --> 00:20:25.792
because you were still inexperienced.

00:20:31.625 --> 00:20:37.125
I'll squash them... as one of the strong.

00:20:37.125 --> 00:20:45.167
Naturally. Not having students in
the roles of "the strong" and "the weak"

00:20:45.167 --> 00:20:49.000
would run counter to my educational principles.

00:20:50.833 --> 00:20:55.167
Allow me to give you some guidance,
for your own sake.

00:20:55.167 --> 00:20:59.708
About the aptitude of the one
standing at the peak: the leader.

00:21:01.208 --> 00:21:05.125
First consider where
and when you want to win.

00:21:05.125 --> 00:21:06.875
Then consider how.

00:21:06.875 --> 00:21:12.333
How will you use loopholes in the rules
to best use the pieces you hold?

00:21:13.667 --> 00:21:15.958
A leader's aptitude.

00:21:15.958 --> 00:21:20.875
Without that, you'll never best me, Asano.

00:21:20.875 --> 00:21:22.708
All right...

00:21:24.542 --> 00:21:27.542
I'll show you my aptitude,

00:21:27.542 --> 00:21:29.333
Mr. Principal, sir.

00:21:42.542 --> 00:21:48.042
<i>The moon that swims in the night sky</i>

00:21:48.042 --> 00:21:53.417
<i>If you stretch out your hand, you can reach it</i>

00:21:53.417 --> 00:21:59.083
<i>I went to touch it: it was warm</i>

00:21:59.083 --> 00:22:04.250
<i>And slowly drew me in</i>

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:15.625
<i>The multiplying footsteps,</i>
<i>the view from my window:</i>

00:22:15.625 --> 00:22:21.208
<i>As I drifted along, expressionless</i>

00:22:21.208 --> 00:22:25.625
<i>They spilled out of my hands</i>

00:22:25.625 --> 00:22:32.458
<i>It was rocking, swaying--I never knew</i>

00:22:32.458 --> 00:22:37.958
<i>Until I touched it with my own hands</i>

00:22:37.958 --> 00:22:43.458
<i>I'll gather up</i>
<i>and go through all of the things</i>

00:22:43.458 --> 00:23:02.102
<i>Scattered beneath the waning moon</i>
